<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Retail Point of Sale (POS) & Fiscal Integration</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            A high-velocity retail interface engineered for the complexities of the Zimbabwean multi-tender 
            environment, providing seamless fiscal compliance and real-time inventory synchronization.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Multi-Tender and Mobile Money Prowess</h2>
        <p>
            Experience a retail interface designed for speed and flexibility. Our POS supports 
            every major tender type in Zimbabwe—USD cash, ZiG cash, Swipe (Visa/Mastercard), 
            and mobile money (EcoCash/OneMoney). Automated exchange rate application 
            ensures that multi-currency transactions are calculated correctly every time, 
            reducing cashier errors and speeding up customer throughput during peak 
            trading hours.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native mobile money reconciliation allows for the instant verification of payments, 
            eliminating the friction of manual receipt confirmation and protecting the 
            business from fraudulent payment entries.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Native ZIMRA Fiscal Compliance</h2>
        <p>
            Compliance is integrated directly into the sale process. Pindah POS connects natively 
            to ZIMRA-approved fiscal devices, ensuring that every transaction generates a 
            legally compliant tax receipt in real-time. The system automates VAT 
            reporting and fiscal device heartbeat monitoring, ensuring your retail 
            outlets remain in full compliance with SI.104 regulations without 
            additional administrative overhead.
        </p>
        <p>
            Detailed till reconciliation reports (float-in, cash-out) provide managers with 
            absolute clarity on daily takings, segmented by tender type and cashier 
            session.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Resilient Offline Operations</h2>
        <p>
            Business doesn't stop during connectivity outages. Our POS features a robust offline 
            mode that allows cashiers to continue processing transactions when the network is 
            down. All sales data is cached locally and automatically synchronized with the 
            central ERP as soon as connectivity is restored, ensuring that inventory levels 
            and financial ledgers are always brought back into alignment.
        </p>
        <p>
            Product lookups via barcode, QR code, or predictive name search ensure that even 
            with thousands of SKUs, your frontline team can provide a rapid and 
            professional checkout experience.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

